WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.560
The calendar brings attendance, approved leave and pending corrections into one view.

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:15.920
A senior approves the correction. The day changes to Present; the original record is retained.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:22.840
An eligible absence can be converted to leave after senior approval, with a reason and balance check.

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:29.760
Apply for leave with dates, type and a reason. It remains pending until reviewed.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:35.760
Approved leave appears on the calendar. Pending requests do not silently become attendance.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:41.040
App login is separate from attendance. Photo check-in is shown without accessing a camera.
